<td id="S3.T2.2.9.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_right">4.3%</td></tr>
<tr id="S3.T2.2.10" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="S3.T2.2.10.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left">Architecture and Design Issues</td>
<td id="S3.T2.2.10.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_right">11</td>
<td id="S3.T2.2.10.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_right">2.9%</td></tr>
